@baseUrl = http://localhost:5039

### Enabled module manifests (adjust baseUrl to the aiservice URL in Aspire)
GET {{baseUrl}}/examples

### Available agents; M365 agents appear only with Examples:copilot365:Enabled=true
GET {{baseUrl}}/agents

### Copilot 365 host metadata; its compatible API key remains microsoft365
GET {{baseUrl}}/vendors

### Inspect the host prompt without calling a model
POST {{baseUrl}}/harness
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agent": "M365Copilot",
  "vendor": "microsoft365"
}

### Read-only workplace chat (invokes the configured model)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What is blocking the Q3 launch? Cite the sample sources.",
  "agent": "M365Copilot",
  "vendor": "microsoft365",
  "disabledTools": ["SendMail"]
}

### Research with work content and Wikipedia (invokes the configured model)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Research the SSO requirement in the sample work content and explain SSO using Wikipedia.",
  "agent": "M365Researcher",
  "vendor": "microsoft365"
}

### Quantitative analysis (invokes the configured model)
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Read the FY26 budget and calculate how much 4 percent under the 4.2 million budget is.",
  "agent": "M365Analyst",
  "vendor": "microsoft365"
}